            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mwimwi mundauza muambe, “Kpwa utu wani Mwenyezi Mlungu akahuhendera hivi?” Undaambira, “Vivyo ambavyo mwaniricha na kuhumikira milungu ya chijeni kpwenye tsi yenu, mundaahumikira ajeni kpwenye tsi ambayo si yenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
